  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Lot chose him all the plain of Jordan, Gen. 13:11. man whom the Lord doth choose, Num. 16:7. man’s rod, whom I shall choose, shall blossom, Num. 17:5. thy God hath chosen thee to be a special people, Deut. 7:6. thy God hath chosen him out of all thy tribes, Deut. 18:5. choose life, that both thou and thy seed may live, Deut. 30:19. choose you this day whom ye will serve, Josh. 24:15 (Alma 30:8; Moses 6:33). choose him out of all the tribes of Israel, 1 Sam. 2:28. See ye him whom the Lord hath chosen, 1 Sam. 10:24. Lord the God, who didst choose Abram, Neh. 9:7. whom he hath chosen for his own inheritance, Ps. 33:12. chose the tribe of Judah, Ps. 78:68. I have chosen the way of truth, Ps. 119:30. the Lord … will yet choose Israel, Isa. 14:1 (2 Ne. 24:1). Jacob whom I have chosen, Isa. 41:8. Ye are … my servant whom I have chosen, Isa. 43:10 (Matt. 12:18). they have chosen their own ways, Isa. 66:3. death shall be chosen rather than life, Jer. 8:3. In the day when I chose Israel, Ezek. 20:5.",
